      "title": "Canva launches Canva Craft image model that plans layouts before generation",
      "summary": "Canva launched Canva Craft, an in-house image generation model built on a two-stage architecture. The model plans design structure before synthesizing imagery, which Canva says provides greater precision, consistency, and control compared to existing competing models.",
