      "title": "Microsoft Research introduces Flint-interactive for agent-generated interactive data visualizations",
      "summary": "Microsoft Research unveiled Flint-interactive, a specialized language that allows AI agents to synthesize interactive data visualizations. Users can click charts, filter datasets, and highlight related elements, exploring dimensions beyond what the initial system author pre-selected.",
