        "Provides a formal language for agents to generate interactive visualizations.",
        "Enables dynamic filtering, cross-highlighting, and exploration beyond initial views."
      ],
      "design_implication": "When reviewing an analytics dashboard, users frequently hit dead ends with static charts generated by conversational assistants. Dynamic visualization languages allow agents to emit exploratory UI widgets rather than flat graphics. That changes analytics design from rendering finished views to defining interactive manipulation primitives. Start auditing conversational reporting tools to replace static chart images with manipulable state controls.",
